      "writtenOn": "2022-10-27T13:39:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e What enforces that entry is page-aligned?\n\nAs `adrp` effectively page-aligns (down) the symbol, `cmp` can only succeed if `entry` was aligned to begin with.\n\n\u003e Could we remove that assumption\n\nWe could even just use `adr` but why do you want to allow `entry` to be unaligned?",
